          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Are Dick's treadmills good?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "They are typically mainstream home treadmills, so quality depends on the specific model rather than the store. Judge each one on continuous horsepower, running surface, maximum user weight and warranty, and compare it line by line with the nearest mainstream model from the same manufacturer.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Can you try treadmills at Dick's?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Often, yes — many stores have floor models, which is one of the main advantages of buying there. Wear your own shoes, walk and run at your usual speeds, use the incline and fold the machine. Floor selection varies, so check whether the model you want is on display before visiting.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Does Dick's deliver and assemble treadmills?",
